=== layout: prompt

# Breakout Room Chat

@prompt

What everyday object deserves a warning label, and what should it say?

@examples

Introduce yourself, then share your warning. A snooze button: "May cause accidental time travel." A LEGO brick: "Shoes strongly recommended." What would your group put on the label?

