=== layout: one-panel

# Optional Background Reading

@body

- There is no required textbook for this course.
- Optional reference: _Biotechnology: The Technological Applications of Genetics and Genomics_, third edition, Clark and colleagues.
- Tonight: regulation, biosafety, clinical evidence, and intellectual property. This set uses outside sources rather than one textbook chapter.
- Use the assigned Set #6 topic list and appropriate outside sources to prepare.

